{"product_id":"the-real-heroes-of-telemark-the-true-story-of-the-secret-mission-to-stop-hitlers-atomic-bomb","title":"The Real Heroes of Telemark : The True Story of the Secret Mission to Stop Hitler's Atomic Bomb","description":"\u003cp\u003eSixty years ago, four men parachuted onto a Norwegian glacier, equipped with only the most basic equipment. Their mission was to prevent the Nazi regime from building an atomic bomb. Now, wilderness expert Ray Mears tells the true story of this gruelling campaign, showing how these men's ability to survive in extreme conditions influenced the outcome of the Second World War. The Telemark campaign was an example of the bravery and skill of the SOE trainees. The Norwegians transformed a military disaster into a triumph. This book will tell the full story for the first time.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 162 x 245\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Raymond Mears\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340830154\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45368082727065,"sku":"15RA-4-9780340830154","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68188d9fc9857-The-Real-Heroes-of-Telemark-The-True-Story-of-the-Secret-Mission-to-Stop-Hitler-s-_2001_1.jpg?v=1748277716","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-real-heroes-of-telemark-the-true-story-of-the-secret-mission-to-stop-hitlers-atomic-bomb","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}